{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-175244-r4518110","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Betty's Salad","sourcePageId":175244,"sourceRevision":"4518110","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-21T16:15:09Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Betty's%20Salad&oldid=4518110","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:24:42.134Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Midwestern U.S. recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for salad","Category:Recipes using bacon","Category:Recipes using bean sprout","Category:Recipes using granulated sugar","Category:Recipes using hard-cooked egg","Category:Recipes using spinach","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Very Easy recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"02d4e247afdbbeb8f92055d459f155eab5138ce726bb09894d55309b90df2b70","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Salad recipes\n| Difficulty = 1\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\n'''Betty's Salad''' is a regional, Midwest salad created by Betty Timko and featured as a menu item at her restaurant, Timko's Soup and Such, in Toledo, Ohio.  The restaurant was located in a brick building at the northwest corner of Sylvania and Douglas Roads of the Devaux Village strip mall in West Toledo [http://www.toledotalk.com/cgi-bin/tt.pl/article/3620/Timkos_Soup__Such]. After Betty died, the restaurant closed, and her signature salad dressing is still produced and distributed at regional grocery stores. \n== Ingredients ==\n\n=== '''Salad''' ===\n* ½ package fresh [[Cookbook:Spinach|spinach]]\n* 6 [[Cookbook:Hard Boiled Eggs|hard boiled eggs]], [[Cookbook:Slicing|sliced]]\n* 1 can [[Cookbook:Bean Sprout|bean sprouts]], drained\n* 1–2 cans [[Cookbook:Water Chestnut|water chestnuts]], drained and sliced (optional, depending on the recipe you follow)\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Pound|pound]] fried [[Cookbook:Bacon|bacon]], crumbled\n\n=== '''Salad dressing''' ===\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Vegetable oil|salad oil]]\n* ¾ cup white granulated [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n* ¼ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] salt, or to taste\n* ⅓ cup [[Cookbook:Ketchup|catsup]]\n* ¼ cup white [[Cookbook:Vinegar|vinegar]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoon]] [[Cookbook:Worcestershire Sauce|Worcestershire sauce]]\n* 1 small to medium-sized [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]], [[Cookbook:Mincing|minced]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n# Layer the salad ingredients in the order listed.\n# Mix all the dressing ingredients in [[Cookbook:Blender|blender]]. Pour over salad.\n# Store salad in fridge.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for salad]]\n[[Category:Midwestern U.S. recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bacon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using hard-cooked egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using spinach]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bean sprout]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]","isRecipe":false,"recipe":{"name":"Betty's Salad","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[],"steps":[{"n":1,"text":"Layer the salad ingredients in the order listed.","sourceText":"Layer the salad ingredients in the order listed.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":2,"text":"Mix all the dressing ingredients in blender. Pour over salad.","sourceText":"Mix all the dressing ingredients in blender. Pour over 